    <h2>Dairy Queen Blizzard Treat — Complete 2026 Guide</h2>
    <p>The <strong>Dairy Queen Blizzard Treat</strong> is the most iconic fast-food dessert in America. First introduced in 1985, the Blizzard is made by hand-blending DQ's signature soft serve with your choice of mix-ins — real cookie pieces, candy bars, brownies, or fruit — until the dessert is thick enough to hold upside down. If the crew forgets to flip it before handing it over, it's free. That's not a marketing slogan. That's a genuine guarantee built into every DQ transaction.</p>
