    <ul>
      <li><strong>Dipped Strawberry Cheesecake Blizzard</strong> — Strawberry cheesecake pieces and fudge swirl. From $4.49, ~540 cal (Small).</li>
      <li><strong>S'mores Blizzard</strong> — Graham cracker pieces, marshmallow topping, and fudge. A fan favorite returning by popular demand. From $4.49, ~500 cal.</li>
